# The Old Man and the Harpoon (adoulin, call-only), 2542's rewards at midpoint rates: a level 99 Warrior in
# Western Adoulin, the quest accepted and the Extravagant Harpoon (GMs), and the quest's own var Quest[9][77]Prog 1
# (a GM).
# EXP_RATE 1.125 (562.5) and BAYLD_RATE 1.375 (412.5): the bindings round each product half away from zero (llround):
# 563 exp, 413 bayld and BAYLD_OBTAINED 413, where a truncation or a round half to even would give 562 and 412. The raw
# player:completeQuest leaves Quest[9][77]Prog as it is (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it). Talks in pairs
# (Jorin's default 560, then his script).
lists WesternAdoulin/Jorin/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2542
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=93.8,32,152.2 job=WAR lvl=99
setting EXP_RATE 1.125
setting BAYLD_RATE 1.375
quest Adoulin.TheOldManAndTheHarpoon accepted
keyitem ExtravagantHarpoon
charvar Quest[9][77]Prog 1
login
trigger Jorin                           # 560
finish-if-event
trigger Jorin                           # the Extravagant Harpoon: 2542
finish-if-event                         # 2542's finish: completed, 563 exp, 413 bayld, BAYLD_OBTAINED 413, fame 30
